This directory is intentionally empty in the committed repo.

It holds `level-00.json` .. `level-32.json`, the 33 Godot-generated parity traces
described in ../README.md. They are generated by running
`tools/godot-trace/trace.gd` against a real Godot 4.6 + `SwingBy2026` checkout (not
available in the container T-01 KEPLER was implemented in) and then committed here.

Until those files exist, `packages/core/test/parity/parity.test.ts` skips with an
explicit message rather than passing vacuously. See ../README.md and
results/T-01-KEPLER.md for the full status.
